# CR 400.7, 608.2h: Delver of Secrets' upkeep ability resolves without its source. Bot2 Bolts Delver in response to the
# trigger; as it resolves Bot1 still looks at the top card, Lightning Bolt, and may reveal it, but "transform this creature"
# finds nothing - the card in the graveyard is a new object and nothing returns or transforms.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Delver of Secrets
Island x5
Lightning Bolt
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delver of Secrets.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack = Delver of Secrets
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Delver of Secrets)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Delver of Secrets
Bot1.Looked = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Revealed = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
